<title>PHILIPPINES: PH-ADR Philippine stocks traded abroad.</title>
<headline>PH-ADR Philippine stocks traded abroad.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Closing prices of Philippine stocks traded on Wall Street on Tuesday as the U.S. equities market was closed on Christmas Day, December 25:</p>
<p> Company   Close	 Net Change  High     Low	 Volume</p>
<p> PLDT	US$53 7/8   +2 1/4	54 1/8   53 3/4    92400</p>
<p> Benguet   US$0 12/32  +0 2/32     0 12/32  0 10/32   15800</p>
<p> 1st Phil  US$14 5/8   No change   14 3/4   14 5/8    10500</p>
</text>
